  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Warm &amp; Spicy Scent</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Phthalates</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Formaldehydes</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Warm & Spicy </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm & Sheer</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Notes:</strong> Bergamot, Jasmine, Musk</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Fragrance Description:</strong> This long-lasting, clean fragrance opens with soft, bright notes of bergamot and pear, gently unfolding into a floral heart of jasmine, rose, and violet. It’s balanced by a base of vanilla, musk, and moss, giving it a warm, second-skin finish that wears for up to over 12 hours.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>About the Fragrance:</strong> Inspired</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p >- Spray onto your wrists, neck, and pulse points — the natural warmth of your body will help diffuse the scent throughout the day.&nbsp;</p><p>- Avoid rubbing or dabbing your skin as this breaks down the fragrance, causing it to wear off more quickly.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Clinical Results:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;<br>Immediately after use:<br>96% agree this fragrance smells clean<br>86% agree this fragrance smells complex<br>83% agree this fragrance has a warm, second-skin finish<br><br>After 8 hours of wear:&nbsp;<br>93% agree this fragrance is still identifiable on my skin&nbsp;<br>90% agree this fragrance lasts&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Alcohol Denat., Fragrance (Parfum), Water, Butylmethoxydibenzoylmethane, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Benzoate, Benzyl Salicylate, Cinnamal, Citral, Coumarin, Hexyl Cinnamal, Linalool, Hexadecanolactone, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Trimethylbenzenepropanol, Jasmine Oil/Extract, Rose Ketones.<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
